      "html": "<p>Observables are yet another way to handle asynchronicity in JS.<br>You can think of them as Promises on steroids but there’s more to them than just that.<br>You can think of them as arrays whose items arrive asynchronously over time.<br>What can you do next with them? Let’s find out.</p>"
